    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ya ng'wa Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni akasola ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī hū ūmala ū kūzenga ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nī numba y'ikūlū ī ya kwikala wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Solomoni wīzenga būpya ī mizengo īyo walī winhwa na Hilamu, hūna ūbatūūla mo Baisilaeli kwikala mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu shikū jenījo ū Solomoni ūja Hamasi-zoba, ūūkagūdumīla ū nzengo gwenūyo ūgūdima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūzenga na nzengo gwa Tedimooli mu sī yitogolo ikalamuku, hamò nī mizengo ī yīngī ī yose īyo akīzenga ipandī lya Hamasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī mizengo ya Holoni wīzenga hangī, ū gwa kū ntulumenho nū gwa kū ngūlya; ī mizengo yenīyo wīzengeela ndugu, wītūūlīla na milyango na malugalīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūzenga na nzengo gwa Baalati, nī mizengo yakwe ī yose ī ya kūbīkīla shikolo; nī ya kūtūūlīla magogoteni gakwe, nī ya falasa jakwe. Na nzenga jingī ūbeeja gīt'ūmo walī atogelilwe, ū mu Yelusalemu nī Lebanoni nūūlū mapandī gangī ū mu sī ī yose īyo yalī ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīho banhū abo baalī balekeelwa kūfuma mu mahanga ga Bahītī, Baamooli, Bapelizi, Bahīvī na Bayebusi, (a banhū benaba baalī batī Baisilaeli). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalī ba shibyalīlwe sha banhū abo bakasaagīīla ū mu sī; abo Baisilaeli bakaleka ū kūbabūlaga. Na lūūlū a banhū benaba ū Solomoni ūbatūūla mu milīmo ya kūhadīkījiwa, būyūtūmama milīmo ya nyasese, kūshisha na lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Solomoni atatūūlile Baisilaeli bose bose mu būsese kūlwa milīmo yakwe; a bene baalī bashilikale bakwe, bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale bakwe, na bataale ba magogoteni gakwe, na badamhīji ba falasa bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benaba baalī bataale ū mu būsugibo ng'wa Solomoni, ū nīmo gwabo gwalī kūkomeleja batūmami; a bose baalī magana abīlī na makūmi atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Solomoni ūng'wīnja ū nke wakwe, ū nshīke o ng'wa Falao ū mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi, ūng'wenha ū kwikūlū īlo akanzengela; nguno akiyangūla wei ng'wenekīlī ūhaya, “Ū nke wane atigeleelilwe kwikala ū mu numba ya ikūlū lya ng'wa Daūdi ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, nguno a mapandī ayo lizile kwikala ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA galī meela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shitambò sha kūpemvwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Solomoni ūmfunīja ū SEEBA shitambò sha kūpemvwa, a ha ng'walīlo ūyo walī wagūzenga kū būtongi w'ibīndo, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūfunya gīt'ūmo shalī shīmīle sha kafunīje ka būlī lūshikū, ūmo Musa walī walagīīlīla kūlwa shikū ja Sabato na shigukulu sha ng'weji mpya, nī shigukulu ī shidatū īsho shalī shalagīlwa, shigukulu sha migatī ītī na shibimbya, shigukulu sha mifungo, na shigukulu sha maduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūūla na magele ga bagabīji būlī bene kūlondeela ndīīma jabo gīt'ūmo kaalī katongeelele ka ng'wa ise Daūdi; na a Balawī kūlwa kūtongeela ng'wikanza lya kūlamya, na kūbagunanha a bagabīji mu milīmo ya būlī lūshikū. Na a ha milyango ūtūūla balang'hani būlī hene, kūlwa kūlang'hana gīt'ūmo jalī jihelelilwe ndīīma jabo; nguno h'ūmo walī walagīīlīla ū Daūdi, ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batakīlanhije nūūlū gūmo ū mu mihayo īyo walī wīlagīīla ū ntemi kūlwa nguno ya bagabīji na Balawī, nī ya balang'hani ba ha chumba sha sabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī milīmo īyo Solomoni walī walagīja gīkī yītwe, yītwa kwandīja lūshikū lwa kūtūūlwa nsingi gwa hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA kūshisha lūshikū lwa kwīmala ī nzenga; yūmalwa ī nzenga ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Solomoni ūja Ezioni-geba na Elasi kū ng'walo gwa Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hilamu ūtūma koi meli jakwe hamò na batūmami bakwe, abo baalī bīmanīīlile ī mihayo ya mu nyaza; būja Ofili hamò na a banhū ba ng'wa Solomoni, būūkashoka na tani ikūmi na mpungatī ja zahabu, būng'wenhela ū ntemi Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
